{"id":"6ed78135d2cc20c6","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-bounded-quantifier.md","title":"Strict and Nonstrict Bounded Quantifiers","display":"df-bounded-quantifier — Strict and Nonstrict Bounded Quantifiers","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-bounded-quantifier","aliases":["92-df-bounded-quantifier"],"display":"df-bounded-quantifier — Strict and Nonstrict Bounded Quantifiers","source":"第 II 章 pp. 14–17；第 VI 章 pp. 79–82（PDF 31–34、96–99）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-term]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-bounded-quantifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-bounded-quantifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-quantifier — Strict and Nonstrict Bounded Quantifiers"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 14–17；第 VI 章 pp. 79–82（PDF 31–34、96–99）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> 是自由变量函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bdvar}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G^2\\to\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{bdvar}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G^2\\to\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> 是下文定义的见证变量选择器。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;,\\leq\">\\(&lt;,\\leq\\)</span> 是下文定义的对象语言关系缩写，不是本地签名的新增原始符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{bdvar}_G(s,t)&amp;\\coloneqq\nv_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\}},\\\\\nz&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{bdvar}_G(s,t),\\\\\ns&lt;t&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists z\\;(s+S(z)=t),\\qquad\ns\\leq t\\coloneqq\\exists z\\;(s+z=t),\\\\\n(\\forall x&lt;t)\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to\\varphi),&amp;\n(\\exists x&lt;t)\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x(x&lt;t\\land\\varphi),\\\\\n(\\forall x\\leq t)\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x(x\\leq t\\to\\varphi),&amp;\n(\\exists x\\leq t)\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x(x\\leq t\\land\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{bdvar}_G(s,t)&amp;\\coloneqq\nv_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\}},\\\\\nz&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{bdvar}_G(s,t),\\\\\ns&lt;t&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists z\\;(s+S(z)=t),\\qquad\ns\\leq t\\coloneqq\\exists z\\;(s+z=t),\\\\\n(\\forall x&lt;t)\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to\\varphi),&amp;\n(\\exists x&lt;t)\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x(x&lt;t\\land\\varphi),\\\\\n(\\forall x\\leq t)\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x(x\\leq t\\to\\varphi),&amp;\n(\\exists x\\leq t)\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x(x\\leq t\\land\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补全 Rosser 比较所用的非严格界。展开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\leq t\">\\(s\\leq t\\)</span> 时，内部存在变量不能捕获任一输入项的变量；选择器排除两项的全部自由变量。选出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 仅在关系缩写内部绑定，外层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 不在其作用域内。</p>\n<p>原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_E\">\\(\\mathcal L_E\\)</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> 当作原始关系，本地仅有等式，因此用加法图定义顺序。这里“有界公式”仍是将这些关系视作派生关系后的语法分类；展开到纯等式语言时会出现内部存在见证，不能按未经定义的原始 token 计数量词。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 II 章 pp. 14–17；第 VI 章 pp. 79–82（PDF 31–34、96–99）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bdvar}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G^2\\to\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"<,\\leq","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}quantifier}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{bdvar}_G(s,t)&\\coloneqq\nv_{\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N\\mid v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\}},\\\\\nz&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{bdvar}_G(s,t),\\\\\ns<t&\\coloneqq\\exists z\\;(s+S(z)=t),\\qquad\ns\\leq t\\coloneqq\\exists z\\;(s+z=t),\\\\\n(\\forall x<t)\\varphi&\\coloneqq\\forall x(x<t\\to\\varphi),&\n(\\exists x<t)\\varphi&\\coloneqq\\exists x(x<t\\land\\varphi),\\\\\n(\\forall x\\leq t)\\varphi&\\coloneqq\\forall x(x\\leq t\\to\\varphi),&\n(\\exists x\\leq t)\\varphi&\\coloneqq\\exists x(x\\leq t\\land\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"s\\leq t","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq","display":false}],"bytes":2245,"backlinks":[{"id":"d754a154b50a9533","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a769d89316a99993","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9252d4105cc5f189","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ae2aea0052d422dc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-bounded-quantifier]]与[[92-thm-sigma1-completeness]]属于本地 $Q$ 的有界/见证推理；原书 (Q)、(R) 的呈现与本库七公理 $Q$ 不逐字相同。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[92-df-bounded-quantifier]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-bounded-quantifier]]"}],"outgoing":["5a1bd470754681a7","4ef6f65f207e8439","d666a3e3ee6c8148","b9e3d57e94ce36b7"]}